# Dependencies and lockfiles
**/node_modules/
**/package-lock.json
**/npm-shrinkwrap.json
**/pnpm-lock.yaml
**/yarn.lock

# TestStep / framework build artifacts
**/index.zip
**/fc/
**/routine/
**/assets/
# Nuxt-app/assets/css 是源码（nuxt.config.ts 引用），其余为构建产物
!Nuxt-app/assets/
Nuxt-app/assets/*
!Nuxt-app/assets/css/
**/.pcg/
**/.nuxt/
**/.nitro/
**/.output/
**/.ts-build/
**/dist/

# Generated fixture data
**/views/__filler/
.local-test/

# Logs and local files
*.log
*.jsonl
.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# 公网回归保留上游源码资源和依赖锁，构建输出仍忽略。
!public-projects/**/package-lock.json
!public-projects/**/npm-shrinkwrap.json
!public-projects/**/pnpm-lock.yaml
!public-projects/**/yarn.lock
!public-projects/**/.env.sample
!public-projects/**/.env.template
!public-projects/**/src/assets/
!public-projects/**/app/assets/
!public-projects/**/public/assets/
public-projects/**/.next/
public-projects/**/.astro/
public-projects/**/.turbo/
public-projects/**/out/
public-projects/**/*.tsbuildinfo
